sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (curl / opencode)
    participant N as nginx :11437 (TLS)
    participant LL as litellm :4000
    participant PG as bundled Postgres
    participant R as llama-server router
    participant M as model files<br/>(var/lib/llama)
    participant P as child llama-server<br/>(model X)
    participant OT as OTEL collector

    C->>N: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization Bearer sk-... (TLS 1.3, local CA)
    N->>LL: proxy_pass via litellm.sock
    LL->>PG: validate virtual key
    alt key invalid or over budget
        LL-->>C: 401 / 400 (never reaches the GPU)
    end
    LL->>LL: enforce key RPM/TPM,<br/>max_parallel_requests,<br/>global_max_parallel_requests
    note over LL: over the cap? queue here,<br/>not on the GPU
    LL->>R: send to the model pinned router
    note over LL,R: one api_base per GGUF: always this router
    R->>R: route by "model" field
    alt model X not loaded
        R->>M: read GGUF, spawn child
        M-->>R: model X loaded
    end
    R->>P: proxy to child
    P-->>R: SSE stream
    R-->>LL: stream
    LL-->>N: stream
    N-->>C: SSE stream (proxy_buffering off)
    LL->>PG: spend log (batched every 60s)
    LL-->>OT: span: model, deployment id, latency, tokens
